0bconfig_enabled.go | Parses debug-only environment settings. |\r\n| internal/\u200bdebug/\u200bconfig_enabled_test.go | Tests parsing and invalid values. |\r\n| internal/\u200bdebug/\u200bconfig_disabled.go | Disables overrides in regular builds. |\r\n| internal/\u200bdebug/\u200bconfig_disabled_test.go | Tests environment isolation. |\r\n| internal/\u200bconfig/\u200brefreshable.go | Applies build-gated expiry overrides. |\n</details>\n\n<sub>Review effort: Balanced</sub>","state":"COMMENTED","submittedAt":"2026-10-19T14:53:27Z","lastEditedAt":null,"url":"https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14752#pullrequestreview-5573425256","author":{"__typename":"Bot","login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/946600?v=4"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDODKw3uc8AAAABTDUfCw","body":"","state":"COMMENTED","submittedAt":"2026-10-19T15:00:08Z","lastEditedAt":null,"url":"https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14752#pullrequestreview-5573517067","author":{"__typename":"User","login":"babakks","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36728931?v=4","name":"Babak K. Shandiz"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDODKw3uc8AAAABTDUhBw","body":"","state":"COMMENTED","submittedAt":"2026-10-19T15:00:10Z","lastEditedAt":null,"url":"https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14752#pullrequestreview-5573517575","author":{"__typename":"User","login":"babakks","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36728931?v=4","name":"Babak K. Shandiz"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDODKw3uc8AAAABTDW24g","body":"Hey @babakks,\n\nSorry, I have to leave as my day is over. This is a slightly sloppy review starting point \ud83d\ude05\n\nI feel 3/10 strongly about the testing comments. However, I feel strongly about the rebuild decision because plain `make` should reliably produce a regular build.\n\nThe PR description is very helpful, especially the walkthrough and reviewer notes.\n","state":"COMMENTED","submittedAt":"2026-10-19T15:03:07Z","lastEditedAt":null,"url":"https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14752#pullrequest